This directory contains declarations that may be used by Mbed TLS.
These declarations are not part of the TF-PSA-Crypto API, and may
be changed or removed without notice.

Over the life time of TF-PSA-Crypto 1.x and Mbed TLS 4.x, we intend
to remove all dependencies of Mbed TLS on these unstable interfaces,
and corresponding minor releases of TF-PSA-Crypto will stop providing
these interfaces.

This directory also contains definitions of structured types which
are exposed by TF-PSA-Crypto. Consider these types to be opaque:
the existence of the type is public, but the list of fields of the
structure is an implementation detail which may change in minor releases.
(In such cases, the field layout is part of the ABI of TF-PSA-Crypto,
however, so changes to these structures will lead to a change of the
TF-PSA-Crypto ABI version if they affect the default configuration.)
